.TH man 1 "2026-11-19" "0.20.0" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH NAME
/tray

.SH DESCRIPTION
Display an icon in the system tray to indicate new messages. Clicking the icon acknowledges current messages and resets the alert until new messages arrive. Unread indicators in chat windows remain untouched so you can still see where to reply.

.SH SYNOPSIS
/tray on|off

.LP
/tray read on|off

.LP
/tray timer <seconds>

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBon|off\fR
.RS 4
Show tray icon.
.RE
.PP
\fBread on|off\fR
.RS 4
Show tray icon when no unread messages.
.RE
.PP
\fBtimer <seconds>\fR
.RS 4
Set tray icon timer, seconds must be between 1-10.
.RE
